  "sentence": "Electronic Safe User Manual. OPENING THE SAFE FOR THE FIRST TIME: Upon first use, users should open the safe with the emergency key. INSERTING THE BATTERIES: Insert four AA batteries, and the green light will flash. If both the green light and the red light are on, replace the batteries. SETTING A PASSWORD: With the door open, press the reset button. Then, input a four-digit password and press the \"enter\" button. When the new password is set, the green light will flash twice. OPENING THE DOOR WITH A PASSWORD: Input your password and press the \"enter\" button. CAUTION: A wrong password input will set off an alarm.",
